<BaseLayout title="AI Tools for Writers (2026): The Complete Stack" description="A complete guide to AI tools for writers in 2026. The 7 tools every writer needs, the 5 workflows, the 3 use cases, and the 3 things to avoid." keywords="AI tools for writers, writing AI, AI writing stack, AI for content writers, AI writing tools">
